    "source_name": "control-002.ax",
    "source": "axiom 0.2;\n\nextern tool chosen(label: Text) -> Unit mode read;\nextern tool poll() -> Bool mode read;\n\ntask Main(flag: Bool) -> Unit\nmust {}\n{\n  if flag then {\n    observe selected_true = chosen(\"then\");\n  } else {\n    observe selected_false = chosen(\"else\");\n  }\n  repeat max 3 {\n    observe done = poll();\n  } until done;\n  complete unit;\n}\n",
